1
00:00:04,066 --> 00:00:05,276
[MUSIC PLAYING ON TV]

2
00:00:05,443 --> 00:00:09,113
Yeah, I'm sorry, but I'm not going to watch
the Clone Wars TV series...

3
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:11,820
(Sheldon:)...until I've seen the Clone Wars movie.

4
00:00:12,825 --> 00:00:16,495
(Sheldon:)I prefer to let George Lucas disappoint me
in the order he intended.

5
00:00:18,331 --> 00:00:19,871
Well, I wanna watch it now.

6
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:21,831
(Sheldon:)Then I believe we've arrived...

7
00:00:22,001 --> 00:00:26,001
...at another quintessential Rock, Paper,
Scissors, Lizard, Spock moment.

8
00:00:31,302 --> 00:00:33,132
(Leonard:)Watch whatever you want.

9
00:00:34,096 --> 00:00:35,976
(Raj:)I saw what you did there.

10
00:00:36,807 --> 00:00:38,137
What'd I do?

11
00:00:39,227 --> 00:00:40,807
[PHONE RINGS]

12
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:45,570
Hello? Hey, Howard.

13
00:00:45,733 --> 00:00:47,363
(Leonard(answering phone):)What's wrong?

14
00:00:47,526 --> 00:00:49,696
Uh, okay. Okay, we'll be right there.

15
00:00:50,488 --> 00:00:52,738
- What happened?
- Howard's at the Mars-rover lab.

16
00:00:52,907 --> 00:00:54,947
(Leonard:)He says he's in trouble. DEFCON 5.

17
00:00:55,117 --> 00:00:58,867
(Sheldon:)DEFCON 5? Well, there's no need to rush.

18
00:00:59,664 --> 00:01:02,044
(Girl:)- What?
- DEFCON 5 means no danger.

